---
import Page from "@layouts/Page.astro";
import Section from "@components/Section.astro";
import SectionHead from "@components/SectionHead.astro";
import SectionSub from "@components/SectionSub.astro";
import SectionSub2Col from "@components/SectionSub2Col.astro";
import Organizations from "@components/Organizations.astro";
const title = "About Me";
const subtitle = "Strategy, accessibility, and hands-on execution for content-driven web platforms.";
---

<Page title={title} subtitle={subtitle}>
  <Section>
    <SectionHead title="My Background" />
    <SectionSub>
      <div class="text-pretty">
        <p>I'm a <strong><abbr title="user experience">UX</abbr> Engineer and Senior Front-End Developer</strong> with 26+ years of experience building <strong>accessible, content-driven web platforms</strong>. My work focuses on <strong>experience architecture, front-end engineering, and CMS strategy</strong>, with an emphasis on <strong>usability, performance, and long-term maintainability</strong>.</p>

        <p>I've partnered with agencies, product teams, and public-sector organizations to define goals, clarify <strong>content structure</strong>, and establish <strong>technical direction</strong> before moving into production. I'm most effective in roles where I can help determine <strong>what to build, why it matters, and then build it</strong>.</p>

        <p>Much of my work centers on <strong>WordPress platform architecture</strong>, where I design <strong>scalable content models, editorial workflows, and front-end systems</strong> that support real-world publishing needs. <strong>Accessibility and <abbr title="Web Content Accessibility Guidelines">WCAG</abbr>-aligned practices</strong> are embedded into my approach from the start, ensuring platforms work well for both users and the teams that maintain them.</p>

        <p>While I'm comfortable contributing across the full project lifecycle, my strengths sit at the intersection of <strong><abbr title="user experience">UX</abbr> strategy, content architecture, and front-end development</strong>—collaborating with designers, engineers, and stakeholders to deliver <strong>production-ready, sustainable web solutions</strong>.</p>
      </div>
    </SectionSub>
  </Section>
  <Section>
    <SectionHead title="My Approach" />
    <SectionSub>
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-10 md:gap-16">
        <SectionSub2Col>
          <h3 slot="title">Ask Questions</h3>
          <p>I ask a lot of up-front questions to determine what problems need to be solved. These answers inform how best to proceed with any project. Gathering as much knowledge up front helps prevent rework later in a project.</p>
        </SectionSub2Col>
        <hr class="text-indigo-300" />
        <SectionSub2Col>
          <h3 slot="title">Plan the Best Approach</h3>
          <p>&quot;Content precedes design. Design in the absence of content is not design, it's decoration.&quot;<br /> ―Jeffrey Zeldman</p>
          <p>Content-first design enables me to:</p>
          <ul class="formatted">
            <li>Design layouts that scale as the site content grows</li>
            <li>Build reusable components</li>
            <li>Prevent redesigning flows and screens later in the project timeline</li>
          </ul>
        </SectionSub2Col>
        <hr class="text-indigo-300" />
        <SectionSub2Col>
          <h3 slot="title">Build for Usability & Accessibility</h3>
          <ul class="formatted">
            <li>Create a site that is responsive across all devices and optimized for search engines</li>
            <li>Tailor <abbr title="Content Management System">CMS</abbr> admins to suit the needs of the client</li>
            <li>Employ best <abbr title="User Experience"><abbr title="user experience">UX</abbr></abbr> and accessibility practices to be inclusive of all visitors</li>
          </ul>
        </SectionSub2Col>
      </div>
    </SectionSub>
  </Section>
  <Section>
    <SectionHead title="My Skills" />
    <SectionSub>
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-10 md:gap-16">
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:gap-4">
          <div class="w-full max-w-3xs">
            <h3>Strengths</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="w-full">
            <ul class="formatted">
              <li>Website Construction</li>
              <li>Website Optimization</li>
              <li>Content Strategy</li>
              <li>User Experience Design</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <hr class="text-indigo-300" />
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:gap-4">
          <div class="w-full max-w-3xs">
            <h3>Tools</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="w-full">
            <ul class="formatted">
              <li>HTML</li>
              <li>CSS</li>
              <li>Word Press</li>
              <li>Adobe Creative Suite</li>
              <li>Affinity Design Software</li>
              <li>Figma</li>
              <li>Javascript</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <hr class="text-indigo-300" />
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:gap-4">
          <div class="w-full max-w-3xs">
            <h3>Roles</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="w-full">
            <ul class="formatted">
              <li>Interaction Designer</li>
              <li>Content Strategist</li>
              <li>User Experience Designer</li>
              <li>Front-End Web Developer</li>
              <li>Graphic Designer</li>
              <li>Accessibility Advocate</li>
              <li>Brand Developer</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </SectionSub>
  </Section>
  <Section>
    <SectionHead title="Organizations I've Worked With" />
    <Organizations />
  </Section>
</Page>
